# Generate m17 L17 b02 three blocks scene asset

## Goal

Generate one course scene PNG at `course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b02_three-blocks.png`.

## Scope

- Use the attached BMH course doodle references and locked flat sticker-sheet style.
- Use gpt-image-2 through the built-in image generation workflow.
- Create one 1600 x 900 PNG.
- Show three large rounded doodle building blocks stacked into a tidy centered tower.
- Make the bottom block cream, the middle block yellow, and the top block orange.
- Keep the background plain cornflower blue with generous clean blue space above and on both sides for code-rendered overlays.
- Use thick wobbly black outlines, rounded simple shapes, flat fills only, and the locked palette: cornflower blue, sunflower yellow, tangerine orange, pale cream or warm white, white, and black.
- Avoid people, faces, text, words, letters, numbers, symbols, labels, ambient doodles, motion marks, icons, random props, gradients, texture, shadows, lighting, and perspective depth.

