Generated `course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b02_three-blocks.png` from the built-in image generation workflow using the requested gpt-image-2 prompt and supplied BMH doodle references.

The generated candidate had the correct three-block tower composition but included soft gradients. I used the candidate as the source and hard-mapped it to the locked five-color flat palette before saving the final PNG.

