- Local palette check reports exactly five RGB colors: `#62b3f3`, black, tangerine orange, sunflower yellow, and pale cream.
- Visual inspection confirms three centered stacked blocks, correct color order, generous plain blue negative space, no people, no faces, no text, no symbols, and no decorative clutter.
- `git check-ignore -v course-assets/scenes/module-17/m17_L17_b02_three-blocks.png` confirms the saved asset is under the existing `course-assets/` ignore rule.

