    { label: "${area_3}", description: "${why_it_matters_3}" },
    { label: "All clear", description: "Skip discussion — I know what I want" }
  ],
  multiSelect: true
)
```

If user selects "All clear" → skip to Step 5 (no CONTEXT.md written).

